OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GThe SEMPRE baroque music ensemble
OL,6,     Gperform in a concert organised as
OL,7,     Gpart of the Bucharest Early Music
OL,8,     GSeason on the occasion of Early
OL,9,     GMusic Day 2025. Jonathan Swain
OL,10,     Gpresents.
